<blockquote>
<p>Where may I post a question regarding the use of Foundation personnel like Dr. Bright and Dr. Clef?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>If it's about the characters of Bright or Clef, like the lore surrounding them, then you should post in the Foundation Universe forum (or ask around on IRC or Discord). If you've got a writing-related question, like if you are able to use them, then the Questions Desk is the right spot.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>May I use a character I wrote myself, or do I need to borrow an existing character?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>You can do whichever! Throwaway doctors are very normal and nearly expected, since the inclusion of Bright or Clef or any other major character carries a bit of baggage with them —&nbsp;you know, why is Bright/Clef in this story? Why would they be interviewing this anomaly? When in doubt, just use an original character.</p>

